---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const STREAM_SRC =
  'https://customer-wa9cpywo3l4jte5c.cloudflarestream.com/1751493aaeed0260e9f42f3aa8ab5e1d/iframe?muted=true&loop=true&autoplay=true&poster=https%3A%2F%2Fcustomer-wa9cpywo3l4jte5c.cloudflarestream.com%2F1751493aaeed0260e9f42f3aa8ab5e1d%2Fthumbnails%2Fthumbnail.jpg%3Ftime%3D%26height%3D600&controls=false';
---

<Layout>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="relative bg-slate-900">
      <div class="relative w-full" style="padding-top: 54.32098765432099%;">
        <iframe
          src={STREAM_SRC}
          title="dwntwnsdl.com Downtown Scottsdale hero video"
          loading="lazy"
          style="border: none; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; height: 100%; width: 100%;"
          allow="accelerometer; gyroscope; autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture;"
          allowfullscreen="true"
        ></iframe>
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900 via-slate-900/55 to-slate-900/20"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-end">
          <div class="container-narrow w-full pb-6 pt-16 sm:pb-12 sm:pt-20">
            <p class="mb-3 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widestx text-amber-600 sm:text-xs">
              Downtown Scottsdale · Old Town · Sister to sdldwntwn.com
            </p>
            <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-none text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
              dwntwn<span class="text-amber-600">sdl</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-200 sm:mt-5 sm:text-lg">
              Downtown first. Scottsdale second. The short address for Old Town.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2 sm:mt-8 sm:flex-row sm:gap-3">
              <a href="#opportunity" class="btn-primary pointer-events-auto">The opportunity</a>
              <a href="#acquisition" class="btn-secondary pointer-events-auto">$50,000</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="opportunity" class="section-padding bg-slate-50">
      <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widestx text-amber-700">The opportunity</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">The sister name, downtown-first</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 sm:text-base">
          <p>
            <a href="https://sdldwntwn.com" class="font-medium text-amber-800 underline-offset-2 hover:underline">sdldwntwn.com</a> leads with the city code.
            <strong class="text-slate-900">dwntwnsdl.com</strong> leads with the neighborhood. Same market. Different search path.
          </p>
          <p>
            People look for Downtown Scottsdale and Old Town — galleries, dining, nightlife, events, and walkable luxury.
            This hostname is that phrase compressed: downtown + SDL.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="market" class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widestx text-amber-700">The market</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Old Town is the walkable heart</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Historic core</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Old Town is the original Scottsdale street grid — western storefronts, galleries, and the arts district.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Walkable</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Dinner, a show, and a hotel within a few blocks. Downtown is the part of the city that does not require a car.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Tourism</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Scottsdale sits inside a multi-billion visitor economy. Old Town is where those visitors land after the resort.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Arts & culture</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Galleries, public art, and First Friday energy — a district that already has a name worth owning.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Nightlife & dining</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">The evening map of Scottsdale still routes through downtown. A directory or brand here is local by default.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Lifestyle & real estate</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Infill living and hospitality both sell the same story: you are in the core, not the sprawl.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="uses" class="section-padding bg-slate-50">
      <div class="container-narrow grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widestx text-amber-700">Ideal uses</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Who this name is for</h2>
          <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-700 sm:text-base">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700"></span><span>Luxury real estate and downtown development</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700"></span><span>Events, tourism, and experience brands</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700"></span><span>Arts, galleries, and culture</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700"></span><span>Dining, nightlife, and local directories</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700"></span><span>Hospitality and destination media</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
          <dl class="space-y-5">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-slate-500">Reads as</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Downtown SDL</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-slate-500">Place</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Old Town</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-slate-500">Sister</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">sdldwntwn.com</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-slate-500">Offer</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-amber-700">$50,000</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white py-10 sm:py-12">
      <div class="container-narrow text-center">
        <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-500 sm:text-sm">
          Information presented is for demonstration and educational purposes only and does not constitute an offer of real estate or local services.
          The domain is offered at the stated asking price; terms are subject to a written agreement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
